Physical Decipher scan and six Players Committee image versions of [[Flagship]], left to right, top to bottom:
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-flagship-hires.webp|Physical Decipher scan]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-Flagship-PC-gallery-20071216201429.gif|PC gallery: captured 16 Dec 2007]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-Flagship-June-2017-partial.png|PC partial: June 2017 edition]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-Flagship-PC-E1-2018-07-08.gif|PC full: July 2018 import]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-Flagship-PC-E2-2023-03-31.png|PC full: March 2023 record]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-Flagship-PC-E3-2023-06-18.png|PC full: June 2023 record]].
* [[:File:Dagobah-D-flagship.gif|PC full: July 2026 record]].

The gallery source is the [https://web.archive.org/web/20071216201429id_/http://www.swccgpc.com/cards/dagobah/ds/flagship.gif 16 December 2007 capture]. The partial is from [[:File:PC-Decipher-Errata-June-2017.pdf]], PDF page 8. Later full-image File pages preserve their pinned official Holotable repository sources. Capture time, document edition and repository record dates are not established first publication days. The physical scan retains its [[Strangewayes|strangewayes]] credit and TIFF provenance on its File page.

The full source files are proportionally resized and placed on a labelled white canvas; the source words and marks remain unchanged. The partial retains its blank upper area, rather than adding a reconstructed full face. SHA-256 <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">167ad6d2fb852049c6972eabcfdc637265e51f1c53df9f0e90fd18b1ebb9e718</code>.

